                                                                </tr>
                                                            </tbody>
                                                        </table>

                                                        <p>
                                                            <span>2.</span> Quarterly fee is due on the first day of each quarter
                                                            and must be paid in full up to the prescribed dates given
                                                            below. all the defaulters, after the prescribed date
                                                            will be required to pay fine @@Rs.100/- for the first fifteen days, and there after Rs.50/- per week or part
                                                            thereof for late payment of fee.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p>
                                                            After the end of the prescribed date of each quarter, the bank will accept the
                                                            fees only if the fee book bears the school stamp and is signed by the
                                                            accountant clearly mentioning the total fee due along with the fine.
                                                        </p>
                                                    </td>
